---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 52
    messageMargin: 32
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as Prediction API
    participant Validator as Schema validator
    participant Cascade as Model cascade
    participant Store as Transactional store

    Client->>API: Submit canonical observation
    activate API
    API->>Validator: Validate schema and feature order
    alt invalid observation
        Validator-->>API: Validation failure
        API-->>Client: Reject observation
    else valid observation
        Validator-->>API: Ordered feature vector
        API->>Cascade: Resolve compatible route and infer
        alt incompatible artifacts
            Cascade-->>API: Compatibility failure
            API-->>Client: Reject model route
        else prediction produced
            Cascade-->>API: Label, scores, and feature-value summary
            API->>Store: Commit observation, prediction, and optional alert
            Store-->>API: Persisted identifiers
            API-->>Client: Prediction response
        end
    end
    deactivate API
